WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.960
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:34.760 --> 01:36.200
But I realized

01:36.800 --> 01:38.480
they weren't just meeting secretly.

01:39.360 --> 01:40.200
They were plotting.

01:41.800 --> 01:42.760
Sure enough,

01:43.400 --> 01:46.560
in the clothes he kept close to him,
I found a delicate wooden box.

01:47.160 --> 01:49.400
Inside it were two pills.

01:51.400 --> 01:52.840
They're Breath-Stopping Pills.

01:54.760 --> 01:57.240
I didn't know
what they were planning next,

01:57.320 --> 01:58.760
but I was terrified.

01:58.840 --> 02:00.760
It had to be that woman's idea!

02:02.960 --> 02:04.920
So that day, in front of Prince of Xin,

02:05.000 --> 02:06.840
you knocked over the drink and pastries

02:06.920 --> 02:09.520
because you recognized that vial

02:09.600 --> 02:10.919
and knew what was inside.

02:11.680 --> 02:15.280
I never thought
you'd really find that poison.

02:15.880 --> 02:17.360
I know you're testing me.

02:18.200 --> 02:19.800
But even if it exposes me,

02:20.320 --> 02:23.040
I won't let Prince of Xin
be tricked into drinking that poison.

02:24.360 --> 02:25.880
I'm sure you know too

02:25.960 --> 02:28.400
that butterfly box
was made from Annan rattan.

02:29.560 --> 02:31.520
I did all of this alone.

02:32.040 --> 02:33.960
I won't let that woman
drag Prince of Xin down.

02:35.880 --> 02:38.600
Prince of Xin must have earned
a lot of merit in his last life

02:39.120 --> 02:40.560
to have you guard him like this.

02:42.760 --> 02:45.440
But to slip this drug
without anyone noticing

02:45.520 --> 02:48.200
into the Imperial Medical Office's
decoction for Lady Wang,

02:48.280 --> 02:49.720
you couldn't do it alone.

02:51.160 --> 02:52.960
Mr. Xiao, don't underestimate me.

02:53.600 --> 02:55.960
Our masters may be high and mighty,

02:56.640 --> 02:58.440
but when they truly need something done,

02:58.520 --> 03:01.240
they must still rely
on lowly servants like us.

03:05.520 --> 03:06.880
Where are you going?

03:08.160 --> 03:10.080
Jinghe killed someone.

03:10.160 --> 03:11.560
The evidence is conclusive.

03:11.640 --> 03:13.480
Kill her or punish her, it's up to you.

03:13.560 --> 03:16.240
But as for Zheng,
I'll find out from him myself

03:16.320 --> 03:18.440
what happened to him.

03:18.520 --> 03:20.480
Secretly meeting
a consort is a grave crime.

03:20.560 --> 03:22.240
We can't let palace servants frame him.

03:24.560 --> 03:26.040
Jinghe spins a fine tale,

03:26.120 --> 03:28.120
even she finds it moving.

03:29.200 --> 03:30.600
Too bad it's only the prologue.

03:30.680 --> 03:32.920
Your story hasn't been told yet.

03:33.000 --> 03:34.560
How could I let you go now?

03:34.640 --> 03:36.320
This is life or death.

03:36.400 --> 03:37.720
Don't play games!

03:46.240 --> 03:48.240
Why is this wretch here?

03:48.320 --> 03:49.640
Are you shielding a murderer?

03:49.720 --> 03:51.160
Calm down.

03:51.240 --> 03:53.400
You recognize this ruan, don't you?

03:54.120 --> 03:55.560
You gave it to Lady Wang.

03:55.640 --> 03:57.360
She probably didn't like it.

03:57.440 --> 03:59.360
She never even touched it once.

04:05.840 --> 04:08.360
Poison, butterflies, candles.

04:09.040 --> 04:10.320
Those were done by Jinghe.

04:10.400 --> 04:12.320
But she wasn't behind it all.

04:12.400 --> 04:13.640
It was never her.

04:14.800 --> 04:16.240
You admire Prince of Xin.

04:16.320 --> 04:18.399
How could you bear
to kill the one he loves?

04:19.160 --> 04:20.640
But a mother is different.

04:21.240 --> 04:22.760
As his mother,

04:22.840 --> 04:25.120
how could you not notice that Prince Xin's
frequent trips to the palace

04:25.200 --> 04:26.320
weren't about filial piety?

04:26.920 --> 04:28.560
He wanted to see someone else.

04:28.640 --> 04:31.280
Killing Yushu was your decision.

04:32.840 --> 04:34.920
You knew Jinghe adored Prince of Xin.

04:35.440 --> 04:37.400
Even if she wanted to keep his secret,

04:37.480 --> 04:39.360
she couldn't withstand your questioning.

04:45.080 --> 04:47.040
No. It was me.

04:48.000 --> 04:49.520
I betrayed Prince of Xin.

04:56.320 --> 04:58.160
CULTIVATE SERENITY WITHIN

04:58.760 --> 05:00.760
When Consort Wei
learned Prince of Xin's secret,

05:02.480 --> 05:04.920
it was a weight off my mind.

05:06.440 --> 05:09.080
Prince of Xin admitted
to secretly meeting Lady Wang.

05:09.760 --> 05:11.000
As for the rest,

05:11.800 --> 05:12.960
he didn't say a word.

05:13.880 --> 05:16.640
How could you allow a lowly maid
to set her sights on Prince of Xin?

05:17.160 --> 05:18.640
Even if Jinghe only wanted
to be a concubine?

05:19.640 --> 05:22.160
You sent Jinghe to Prince of Xin.

05:22.240 --> 05:24.800
Because you needed her to spy on him.

05:24.880 --> 05:25.720
And you,

05:26.560 --> 05:28.320
of course, wouldn't turn down
such a sweet deal.

05:28.960 --> 05:30.720
You even knew to repay her kindness.

05:32.920 --> 05:35.760
You brought Consort Wei
the Breath-Stopping Pills.

05:35.840 --> 05:38.760
After you stole them,
Prince of Xin didn't notice?

05:39.600 --> 05:41.080
He noticed soon enough.

05:49.600 --> 05:52.680
I know you're worried about me.

05:52.760 --> 05:53.920
Jinghe,

05:54.560 --> 05:57.360
you don't have to keep kneeling before me
begging for forgiveness.

05:57.960 --> 05:59.440
You didn't do anything wrong.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.400
We're both just doing

06:02.680 --> 06:04.160
what we believe is right.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.040
Lady Wang is pregnant.

06:21.920 --> 06:25.080
Mother, help me get her out of the palace.

06:37.080 --> 06:37.960
You…

06:38.640 --> 06:39.560
You…

06:40.760 --> 06:43.000
Do you even know what you've done?

06:48.320 --> 06:50.080
You went to see Lady Wang

06:50.160 --> 06:52.680
not because you admired her talent

06:52.760 --> 06:54.600
or felt a kinship with her.

06:57.320 --> 06:58.720
Kinship?

07:00.400 --> 07:02.040
What a bitter joke.

07:03.320 --> 07:06.120
That shameless wretch was truly bold.

07:06.680 --> 07:09.640
She already got pregnant by my Zheng.

07:09.720 --> 07:11.080
No shame at all.

07:12.400 --> 07:14.080
You two worked together so well.

07:14.160 --> 07:16.040
After you killed Lady Wang,

07:16.120 --> 07:18.000
to stop anyone from examining the body,

07:18.080 --> 07:21.560
Consort Wei arranged pine shavings
and a river-willow coffin.

07:21.640 --> 07:25.440
And Jinghe carefully prepared
that pretty box of butterflies.

07:25.520 --> 07:27.080
Even after she died,

07:27.160 --> 07:28.720
you still wouldn't let her go.

07:31.400 --> 07:33.160
Then why wouldn't
she let go of Prince of Xin?

07:33.880 --> 07:36.200
I hate to see him lose someone he loves.

07:36.280 --> 07:38.200
But he has been
completely bewitched by her.

07:38.920 --> 07:40.680
To beg Consort Wei,

07:40.760 --> 07:43.160
he'd rather kneel in the rain
for two hours.

07:44.960 --> 07:46.160
All thanks to Yunxiang Powder.

07:47.280 --> 07:48.680
Yunxiang Powder?

07:48.760 --> 07:50.360
Wasn't it the Breath-Stopping Pill?

07:50.880 --> 07:53.200
Zheng, why are you up?

07:55.560 --> 07:56.640
What is Yunxiang Powder?

07:57.240 --> 07:58.720
What did you feed her?

07:59.680 --> 08:00.600
Answer me.

08:00.680 --> 08:02.440
What is Yunxiang Powder?

08:05.800 --> 08:07.280
It's poison.

08:08.400 --> 08:09.840
Colorless, tasteless.

08:10.360 --> 08:12.120
A poison that kills without a trace.

08:15.360 --> 08:17.400
- Why?
- Because she's a madwoman!

08:19.240 --> 08:20.720
So she had to die.

08:26.720 --> 08:30.000
I once tried to reason with her.

08:30.600 --> 08:32.360
She wouldn't listen.

08:32.440 --> 08:33.960
I know

08:34.919 --> 08:36.520
what you were plotting.

08:36.600 --> 08:38.280
Zheng is too naïve.

08:39.240 --> 08:40.640
Your plan

08:41.480 --> 08:42.559
wasn't clever at all.

08:43.840 --> 08:45.360
We had to try to know.

08:46.640 --> 08:49.080
If you can help us keep the secret,

08:49.160 --> 08:50.200
that would be a merit too.

08:50.280 --> 08:53.120
Merit? No, it's a sin!

08:58.760 --> 09:02.000
Look at you, a mere music girl
from the Music Office,

09:02.080 --> 09:03.760
you became

09:03.840 --> 09:06.080
a rank-eight Imperial Consort overnight,

09:06.160 --> 09:09.000
assured of comfort for life.

09:09.720 --> 09:12.640
That's a blessing
so many in this deep palace crave.

09:12.720 --> 09:14.600
What could you possibly still want?

09:21.760 --> 09:24.320
If living is only about a secure life,

09:24.400 --> 09:25.680
that's dreadfully dull.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.360
I don't lack money.

09:27.440 --> 09:29.560
I entered the palace to learn music.

09:29.640 --> 09:32.840
That "blessing" you speak of
means nothing to me.

09:32.920 --> 09:34.960
But to be favored by His Majesty

09:35.840 --> 09:37.320
is the highest honor.

09:38.080 --> 09:39.480
To you, it's an honor.

09:40.000 --> 09:41.280
To me, it's a cage.

09:42.080 --> 09:44.400
If the price of his favor

09:44.480 --> 09:46.520
is losing my freedom
for the rest of my life,

09:47.240 --> 09:48.600
then I don't want it.

09:48.680 --> 09:50.320
So you ignore all decency,

09:50.400 --> 09:53.400
for your selfish desire,
and ruin my Zheng for life?

09:53.480 --> 09:55.200
Ignore all decency?

09:56.120 --> 09:57.480
Selfish desire?

09:58.200 --> 09:59.320
Ruining a life?

10:00.440 --> 10:02.360
With every accusation you throw,

10:03.160 --> 10:06.400
are you describing me
or the Emperor himself?

10:08.720 --> 10:10.600
His Majesty is old enough to be my father.

10:11.200 --> 10:12.240
On a whim,

10:12.320 --> 10:15.000
he made me an Imperial Consort
and then just dropped me.

10:16.120 --> 10:17.720
I could've left this palace,

10:18.640 --> 10:20.440
but now I can only grow old here, alone.

10:22.800 --> 10:24.200
You're just unwilling

10:26.040 --> 10:28.880
to accept you lost his favor so quickly.

10:29.680 --> 10:32.600
I'm unwilling to accept my fate,
changed so easily by others!

10:39.040 --> 10:39.920
Yushu,

10:41.120 --> 10:42.040
have you ever thought

10:43.240 --> 10:45.040
maybe you want too much?

10:45.120 --> 10:46.680
In this palace,

10:47.360 --> 10:49.200
consorts have no more than that.

10:49.280 --> 10:52.520
If you want wealth and glory,
go fight for his favor.

10:53.120 --> 10:54.960
If you want peace and ease,

10:55.800 --> 10:57.440
stay in your place.

10:58.040 --> 10:59.280
What if I want freedom?

11:01.520 --> 11:03.360
To be forgotten by His Majesty

11:03.440 --> 11:06.640
is to be free of the palace's chains.

11:07.240 --> 11:08.680
You like playing the ruan, right?

11:08.760 --> 11:11.440
You live alone in this huge Hanliang Hall.

11:11.520 --> 11:12.640
No one ties you down.

11:12.720 --> 11:14.600
Play whenever you want.

11:14.680 --> 11:16.240
Isn't that freedom too?

11:17.640 --> 11:20.680
For people, freedom is having a choice.

11:21.600 --> 11:22.840
Bending yourself to fit,

11:22.920 --> 11:25.840
finding joy in misery,
it's just lying to yourself!

11:27.680 --> 11:28.640
Look at you.

11:28.720 --> 11:30.400
So what if you're Consort Wei?

11:31.520 --> 11:32.360
How pitiful.

11:34.600 --> 11:37.760
People are pitiful

11:38.760 --> 11:39.800
only when they want too much.

11:41.040 --> 11:42.360
Keep to your place,

11:42.880 --> 11:44.560
know what's proper,

11:45.640 --> 11:47.440
and life will be easy.

11:48.600 --> 11:51.720
All these years,
you've kept to your place.

11:51.800 --> 11:53.440
Not once have you felt wronged?

11:55.120 --> 11:57.320
Night after night,
being neglected by your husband,

11:57.880 --> 11:59.880
did "knowing what's proper"
really get you through?

12:05.960 --> 12:07.600
I have His Majesty's respect,

12:08.560 --> 12:09.880
and I have my Zheng.

12:13.160 --> 12:16.120
We are not alike,
so let us each go our own way.

12:16.840 --> 12:18.600
I didn't need to tell you this much.

12:24.200 --> 12:25.280
I won't see you out.

12:27.160 --> 12:30.840
You probably think
as long as I don't interfere,

12:30.920 --> 12:33.400
you can use the Breath-Stopping Pill
to fake your death

12:33.480 --> 12:34.400
and leave the palace.

12:35.000 --> 12:36.440
But you may not know,

12:36.520 --> 12:37.840
after a consort dies,

12:37.920 --> 12:40.200
the body lies in state
at Mortuary Hall before burial.

12:40.800 --> 12:43.520
The timing and dose of the pill
must be very precise,

12:43.600 --> 12:45.240
or you'll die for real!

12:45.920 --> 12:48.520
If you wake before the burial,
the guards will find you.

12:48.600 --> 12:51.400
After you're buried,
if no one digs you out in time,

12:51.480 --> 12:53.200
you're as good as buried alive!

12:53.800 --> 12:55.320
Zheng may be a prince,

12:55.400 --> 12:58.040
but to secretly move an imperial consort

12:58.120 --> 13:00.640
and send her away,
you think that would be easy?

13:02.600 --> 13:03.600
During this process,

13:04.200 --> 13:07.400
a single misstep will cost you your life.

13:09.600 --> 13:11.520
We keep talking to ourselves.

13:12.120 --> 13:13.680
Prince of Xin and I have it all planned.

13:14.200 --> 13:15.240
I'll get away clean.

13:15.840 --> 13:17.040
He doesn't know

13:17.800 --> 13:20.200
what a mother would do for her child!

13:20.960 --> 13:24.200
I knew she wouldn't give up easily.

13:24.280 --> 13:26.040
I had people watching her.

13:26.840 --> 13:28.600
But I never imagined

13:28.680 --> 13:31.240
she'd dare ask a Medical Officer

13:31.760 --> 13:33.240
to examine her.

13:34.080 --> 13:35.320
Once he examined her…

13:35.400 --> 13:36.280
HANLIANG HALL

13:36.360 --> 13:37.920
…her pregnancy would be exposed.

13:38.000 --> 13:40.320
My Zheng would be dragged into it.

13:40.400 --> 13:44.080
She and the child in her belly

13:44.600 --> 13:46.160
will always be a threat to Zheng.

13:46.760 --> 13:48.480
So she had to die!

13:50.800 --> 13:52.480
You bribed the Medical Officer

13:52.560 --> 13:54.880
and slipped Yunxiang Powder
into her pregnancy tonic.

13:57.080 --> 13:57.920
Yes.

13:58.000 --> 14:00.120
Then you deceived
Prince of Xin into believing

14:00.200 --> 14:01.680
you'd help Yushu flee by faking her death.

14:02.600 --> 14:05.040
But Yushu took too much
of the Breath-Stopping Pill

14:05.120 --> 14:06.400
and never woke up.

14:09.600 --> 14:10.440
Yes.

14:14.200 --> 14:15.360
Mother.

14:17.040 --> 14:18.840
Why didn't you tell me any of this?

14:21.400 --> 14:22.520
Zheng,

14:23.200 --> 14:24.840
you're too honest, too soft-hearted.

14:25.440 --> 14:26.720
That's why people can fool you.

14:27.320 --> 14:29.360
That woman doesn't love you!

14:29.440 --> 14:30.920
She's only using you!

14:31.600 --> 14:34.320
Forget her. Forget all of this.

14:34.960 --> 14:38.320
In the future, you'll have
a proper princess consort,

14:38.400 --> 14:40.600
and you'll have a child with a clean name.

14:41.480 --> 14:43.080
Did you ever think

14:44.560 --> 14:46.800
why Yushu would dare
ask the Medical Officer to examine her?

14:48.320 --> 14:49.720
Either she was foolish

14:50.400 --> 14:53.320
or she meant to threaten me
and get back at me!

14:53.400 --> 14:56.000
But either way, she deserved to die!

15:01.080 --> 15:01.920
No…

15:03.600 --> 15:04.520
No…

15:05.800 --> 15:07.000
I was the foolish one.

15:07.920 --> 15:08.880
Zheng,

15:09.480 --> 15:11.400
what did she do to you?

15:11.960 --> 15:13.920
Of all the women in the world,

15:14.480 --> 15:17.200
why do you cling to her alone?

15:19.680 --> 15:21.080
All my life,

15:21.880 --> 15:23.240
inside these palace walls,

15:24.280 --> 15:26.640
I've never met a woman as vibrant as her.

15:28.760 --> 15:30.680
The first time I saw her
at the Music Office,

15:31.200 --> 15:32.760
I fell for her.

15:33.760 --> 15:36.720
I knew what her heart longed for
wasn't something I could give.

15:37.480 --> 15:40.040
What she wanted was a life of freedom,

15:40.120 --> 15:42.680
traveling the world with a ruan.

15:43.520 --> 15:45.240
So I never dared to wish for more.

15:48.000 --> 15:49.800
To share moments sparring over melodies…

15:49.880 --> 15:50.720
IN VIRTUE LIES TRUE NOBILITY

15:50.800 --> 15:52.240
…weaving lyrics and tunes,

15:52.920 --> 15:54.120
that was blessing enough.

15:54.640 --> 15:58.320
I knew she would soon be free
of her service and the palace.

15:58.920 --> 16:00.440
I hated to see her go,

16:01.040 --> 16:03.040
but I was truly happy for her.

16:03.120 --> 16:06.720
The life she dreamed of
was the life I wanted too.

16:09.040 --> 16:10.160
I couldn't have it.

16:10.760 --> 16:12.840
If she could see it for me,
that was enough.

16:14.640 --> 16:15.840
Until that day.

16:17.520 --> 16:19.280
Father took Yushu to bed.

16:21.200 --> 16:22.040
Where is Yushu?

16:25.640 --> 16:29.120
In that moment, my world spun.

16:29.920 --> 16:33.400
The one I loved lost her freedom for good.

16:34.120 --> 16:36.560
I knew what all of this meant to her.

16:37.480 --> 16:39.480
But he was my father,

16:39.560 --> 16:41.520
the reigning emperor.

16:44.320 --> 16:45.600
There was nothing I could do.

16:49.240 --> 16:50.720
- Zheng.
- Your Highness.

16:50.800 --> 16:52.680
Zheng, what's wrong?

17:07.359 --> 17:08.240
Thank you.

17:10.480 --> 17:11.560
After that,

17:12.960 --> 17:14.640
Yushu moved to Hanliang Hall.

17:17.480 --> 17:19.119
And Father vanished from her life.

17:20.720 --> 17:22.319
Whenever I entered the palace,

17:23.240 --> 17:26.040
I'd take a detour
and stop behind Hanliang Hall.

17:27.040 --> 17:29.960
I just wanted to see
that patch of sky above her.

17:30.040 --> 17:32.360
HANLIANG HALL

17:32.440 --> 17:34.080
If I was lucky,

17:35.160 --> 17:36.960
I'd even hear her ruan.

17:37.680 --> 17:40.400
I could hear all her bitterness and pain.

17:41.400 --> 17:42.640
Later,

17:43.640 --> 17:45.680
she realized she was pregnant

17:47.040 --> 17:48.600
and wanted even more
to leave this deep palace.

17:49.800 --> 17:50.640
Yushu…

17:52.160 --> 17:53.040
Your Highness, help me.

17:55.040 --> 17:56.320
Please rise.

17:58.800 --> 17:59.800
What's the matter?

18:00.400 --> 18:03.920
She said… she had lost the will to live.

18:04.000 --> 18:05.800
But the child became her reason

18:06.920 --> 18:07.760
to go on living.

18:07.840 --> 18:11.520
She could see
the sorrow of women in the harem,

18:12.160 --> 18:13.360
and she could also see

18:14.200 --> 18:16.800
how even an imperial son is bound by fate.

18:17.880 --> 18:20.080
She didn't want her child
to bear any of it.

18:21.400 --> 18:22.720
She wanted to run.

18:23.320 --> 18:24.840
Do you remember

18:24.920 --> 18:26.920
Princess Zhaosi faking
her death at the Lantern Festival?

18:27.720 --> 18:28.720
What are you trying to do?

18:29.720 --> 18:31.240
I wish to do the same.

18:33.200 --> 18:34.320
After that,

18:35.680 --> 18:37.320
I found a way to get
the Breath-Stopping Pill.

18:37.840 --> 18:39.080
Yushu and I planned everything,

18:40.200 --> 18:42.240
but Jinghe and Mother found out.

18:42.920 --> 18:44.880
Mother is usually cautious,

18:45.640 --> 18:47.720
but if she knew that child was mine,

18:48.360 --> 18:49.720
she would've helped me.

18:50.640 --> 18:51.840
I just never thought

18:54.680 --> 18:56.280
I'd get Yushu killed because of it.

18:56.960 --> 18:58.440
You didn't kill Yushu.

18:59.200 --> 19:00.120
Consort Wei did.

19:01.040 --> 19:02.520
And the one she killed

19:02.600 --> 19:04.800
wasn't just a selected lady,

19:04.880 --> 19:06.040
but an imperial heir too.

19:06.120 --> 19:07.840
An imperial heir?

19:09.760 --> 19:12.680
A bastard who can't
be brought into the light,

19:13.200 --> 19:14.720
and you call it an imperial heir?

19:15.360 --> 19:16.360
Mother.

19:17.880 --> 19:19.080
That's not true.

19:20.720 --> 19:21.800
Even now,

19:22.680 --> 19:23.920
you still want to protect her?

19:25.000 --> 19:27.320
That child was a mistake,

19:27.920 --> 19:29.560
a sin.

19:33.080 --> 19:34.560
Are you still going to hide it?

19:36.120 --> 19:37.440
I'll ask you again.

19:38.120 --> 19:40.280
Why did Yushu dare ask
the Medical Officer to examine her?

19:47.400 --> 19:50.160
Because that child was His Majesty's.

19:53.440 --> 19:54.680
Heaven sees all.

19:54.760 --> 19:56.400
Lady Wang's body was burned,

19:57.240 --> 19:59.200
but that only made
the innocent child's bones come to light.

19:59.800 --> 20:00.920
The fetus's bones had formed.

20:01.520 --> 20:04.400
That means Yushu
was at least four months pregnant.

20:04.480 --> 20:06.240
Yushu used to love drinking.

20:07.200 --> 20:08.880
But we investigated.
The maids at Hanliang Hall said

20:09.680 --> 20:11.360
less than a month after her investiture,

20:11.440 --> 20:12.840
she stopped drinking to drown her sorrows.

20:12.920 --> 20:15.000
She used to drink to drown her sorrows.

20:15.080 --> 20:18.320
But later, we never saw her drink again.

20:19.120 --> 20:22.520
Back then, she already realized
she was pregnant.

20:23.480 --> 20:24.720
Less than a month

20:26.600 --> 20:27.680
after her investiture?

20:28.680 --> 20:31.320
Jinghe, you care so much
about Prince of Xin.

20:31.400 --> 20:32.840
You should know exactly

20:32.920 --> 20:35.360
when he started meeting her
at Cheng'en Palace.

20:37.160 --> 20:38.600
It's…

20:40.600 --> 20:41.760
two months ago.

20:42.360 --> 20:43.520
That's right.

20:43.600 --> 20:47.040
The "haunting" rumors at Cheng'en Palace
started two months ago.

20:47.120 --> 20:48.640
Two months ago,

20:49.360 --> 20:51.640
when Lady Wang met Prince of Xin,

20:51.720 --> 20:53.000
she was already three months pregnant.

20:53.080 --> 20:55.520
Yet you never once doubted
Prince of Xin's lies.

20:56.120 --> 20:57.960
That Medical Officer
you bribed and threatened

20:58.560 --> 21:00.560
must have known how far along she was.

21:01.160 --> 21:03.120
But you only worried about Prince of Xin

21:03.200 --> 21:04.920
and never asked about the fetus.

21:05.000 --> 21:06.440
You killed her in haste!

21:06.520 --> 21:09.680
When she was murdered,
the fetus was already five months along,

21:09.760 --> 21:11.040
already shaped like a child.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.080
I didn't know…

21:16.720 --> 21:18.040
I didn't know…

21:21.400 --> 21:22.240
Zheng…

21:24.840 --> 21:26.120
You lied to me.

21:26.200 --> 21:28.520
Why did you lie to me?

21:40.200 --> 21:42.040
But the Imperial Medical Office
has no record.

21:42.120 --> 21:45.080
So who can prove
her child was His Majesty's?

21:46.720 --> 21:48.560
She slept with someone else
and got pregnant with a bastard.

21:49.160 --> 21:51.680
She used Zheng's soft heart
to try to flee the palace.

21:51.760 --> 21:54.120
She almost led my Zheng
into a grave mistake!

21:55.000 --> 21:56.640
I did it for the royal family's honor.

21:56.720 --> 21:58.520
I did it for my child. That's why…

21:58.600 --> 22:00.440
- Mother!
- That's why I did it!

22:01.040 --> 22:02.920
Yushu did it for her child too.

22:03.640 --> 22:05.720
To get the child out of the palace,

22:05.800 --> 22:07.400
she was willing to risk her life.

22:07.480 --> 22:09.520
But because of what you said,

22:09.600 --> 22:11.960
for her child,
she could even give up her freedom.

22:12.560 --> 22:13.440
She had already decided

22:13.520 --> 22:15.320
to spend her whole life
trapped in this palace.

22:16.080 --> 22:18.960
If the Medical Officer truthfully reports
the fetus's age,

22:19.560 --> 22:21.240
that would prove the child

22:23.040 --> 22:24.320
was Father's.

22:25.240 --> 22:26.160
But you…

22:27.640 --> 22:28.880
But I…

22:29.840 --> 22:32.840
But I'm a mother too. A mother!

22:33.920 --> 22:36.200
Now, the truth is clear.

22:36.280 --> 22:37.920
Your Ladyship, close the case.

22:39.840 --> 22:42.560
This case… How should it end?

22:43.160 --> 22:46.360
You plotted against Lady Wang,
poisoned an imperial heir.

22:46.440 --> 22:50.000
And to hide your crimes,
you framed me and Mr. Xiao for an affair.

22:50.600 --> 22:52.800
Consort Wei, will you take it all,

22:52.880 --> 22:55.120
or share some
with Prince of Xin and Jinghe?

23:01.160 --> 23:02.440
I have no guilt to admit.

23:04.320 --> 23:05.680
Fine move.

23:06.400 --> 23:08.720
Jinghe was the perfect scapegoat.

23:08.800 --> 23:11.280
Even if you walk away unscathed,
what about Prince of Xin?

23:11.360 --> 23:12.680
What does that have to do with him?

23:12.760 --> 23:14.680
The sachet he wears every day

23:14.760 --> 23:16.480
was made by Lady Wang.

23:17.320 --> 23:19.440
It may prove little, but that's enough.

23:20.040 --> 23:22.320
I learned that from you.

23:22.400 --> 23:23.560
What happened doesn't matter.

23:23.640 --> 23:26.680
What His Majesty thinks happened
matters most.

23:28.480 --> 23:30.440
So you want revenge.

23:31.200 --> 23:34.320
You want to drag me down together, huh?

23:35.240 --> 23:38.280
If we can't settle this,
we can talk about something else.

23:39.000 --> 23:39.920
What?

23:41.160 --> 23:43.360
Prince of Xin fell at his residence

23:43.440 --> 23:45.240
and hurt himself.

23:46.280 --> 23:48.400
You're trying to clear that wretch?

23:48.480 --> 23:49.520
No chance.

23:50.040 --> 23:51.560
She dared to murder an imperial son.

23:52.160 --> 23:53.760
She must die!

23:55.400 --> 23:56.920
You're right.

23:57.640 --> 24:01.040
Whoever dares murder
an imperial son must die.

24:35.120 --> 24:39.200
IN VIRTUE LIES TRUE NOBILITY

25:03.400 --> 25:06.520
Your Ladyship,
if you get to see Prince of Xin,

25:06.600 --> 25:08.680
could you tell him I'm sorry?

25:09.760 --> 25:10.720
Funny.

25:11.320 --> 25:13.240
He asked me to apologize to you too.

25:16.040 --> 25:18.320
That night, I dreamed of Yushu.

25:19.960 --> 25:21.560
She wanted us to live on.

25:24.720 --> 25:25.840
Where's your pipa?

25:26.440 --> 25:28.160
All of them were from the Music Office.

25:28.240 --> 25:31.200
I don't want to take
a single thing from this palace.

25:33.720 --> 25:35.480
What a pity.

25:36.920 --> 25:39.080
Her Ladyship went to such trouble
to find this pipa,

25:39.160 --> 25:41.040
a hundred-year-old one.

25:41.640 --> 25:43.040
What now?

25:45.640 --> 25:48.280
A hundred years ago,
Xingqing Palace didn't exist.

25:48.360 --> 25:49.600
So it doesn't count as palace property.

25:52.840 --> 25:53.760
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

25:56.440 --> 25:57.280
Thank you, miss.

26:03.800 --> 26:06.440
Listen to her. Live on and live well.

26:19.960 --> 26:21.600
Did you plan this all along

26:21.680 --> 26:24.080
to save Ahao by hiding the truth?

26:25.680 --> 26:28.320
Consort Wei can twist things to her will,

26:28.840 --> 26:30.760
but one thing she said was right.

26:31.400 --> 26:34.160
No one can prove
Yushu's child was His Majesty's.

26:34.240 --> 26:35.920
If this stirs up trouble,

26:36.000 --> 26:37.560
the only one we can convict

26:37.640 --> 26:39.680
is Jinghe, who framed you and me.

26:39.760 --> 26:41.320
Consort Wei will still walk away clean.

26:41.400 --> 26:43.120
If His Majesty grows suspicious,

26:43.200 --> 26:45.280
the one doubted and blamed
will be Prince of Xin.

26:45.360 --> 26:47.640
With a truth this murky,

26:47.720 --> 26:49.360
it's better to trade it for Ahao's life.

26:49.960 --> 26:51.040
That's true.

26:52.240 --> 26:53.280
The truth coming out

26:54.040 --> 26:55.720
isn't always the best ending.

26:57.680 --> 26:59.840
What story did Consort Wei make up
to report to His Majesty?

27:01.280 --> 27:02.640
"Consort Wei loves music,

27:02.720 --> 27:04.440
and she and Lady Wang bonded over it.

27:04.520 --> 27:07.080
Who knew Lady Wang
only wanted to leave the palace,

27:07.160 --> 27:09.360
and even asked Consort Wei for help?

27:09.440 --> 27:10.760
Consort Wei tried
her best to dissuade her,

27:11.360 --> 27:12.640
but Yushu had made up her mind.

27:12.720 --> 27:14.120
She insisted on faking her death.

27:14.720 --> 27:16.320
To spare His Majesty any shame,

27:16.960 --> 27:19.880
Consort Wei had no choice
but to put her to death in grief."

27:21.280 --> 27:23.840
And what of our "scandal"
at Cheng'en Palace?

27:24.440 --> 27:25.840
That night, I didn't go there,

27:25.920 --> 27:28.320
but you and Wuren showed up there.

27:28.400 --> 27:31.760
You'd been investigating for days,
exhausted, and fell asleep.

27:31.840 --> 27:34.240
Eunuch Liu
had been humiliated by you before.

27:34.320 --> 27:35.160
He held a grudge,

27:35.240 --> 27:38.000
so he made up a pack of lies
and spread it everywhere

27:38.080 --> 27:39.640
to ruin your name.

27:39.720 --> 27:41.560
And Consort Wei had him beaten to death.

27:43.200 --> 27:46.040
For one life, one can make up a lie.

27:46.600 --> 27:49.560
To cover a lie, one can sacrifice a life.

27:51.200 --> 27:54.920
Mr. Xiao, I say this case
isn't worth investigating.

27:57.360 --> 27:59.760
PRINCE OF XIN'S MANSION

28:01.760 --> 28:02.720
Your Highness…

28:03.880 --> 28:04.720
I…

28:05.680 --> 28:09.040
Scold me. Or hit me if you want.

28:09.600 --> 28:11.880
Just don't leave me.

28:17.440 --> 28:18.520
Don't worry.

28:20.080 --> 28:22.480
Since I promised Mother
to bring you into this residence,

28:23.120 --> 28:24.400
I won't abandon you.

28:25.280 --> 28:27.000
Everything in this residence,

28:27.720 --> 28:28.760
you may use as you like.

28:29.400 --> 28:30.480
But…

28:32.600 --> 28:35.080
I truly can't stay here any longer.

28:39.520 --> 28:40.760
I used to think

28:42.240 --> 28:43.840
none of us were wrong.

28:46.360 --> 28:48.160
Mother wanted to protect me.

28:49.000 --> 28:50.120
She wasn't wrong.

28:51.520 --> 28:53.040
I wanted to help Yushu.

28:53.640 --> 28:54.760
I wasn't wrong either.

28:55.800 --> 28:56.640
And you,

28:57.840 --> 28:59.960
for a hopeless love,

29:00.560 --> 29:01.840
gave everything willingly.

29:02.720 --> 29:03.800
You weren't wrong.

29:04.960 --> 29:06.320
But now I feel

29:07.520 --> 29:08.800
we were all wrong.

29:11.040 --> 29:11.880
Your Highness…

29:11.960 --> 29:14.640
I thought you were unaware of my feelings.

29:15.480 --> 29:18.600
I thought you always saw me as a servant,

29:19.920 --> 29:22.480
a concubine bound by duty.

29:24.480 --> 29:26.440
So you knew everything…

29:27.200 --> 29:28.240
Jinghe,

29:29.360 --> 29:30.640
I understand

29:31.400 --> 29:32.320
how you feel.

29:34.880 --> 29:36.440
But she'll never know

29:37.720 --> 29:39.080
my feelings again.

29:40.400 --> 29:41.360
Your Highness…

29:42.560 --> 29:44.120
I'm sorry.

29:47.280 --> 29:48.120
Jinghe,

29:48.640 --> 29:50.600
live on and live well.

29:51.120 --> 29:52.080
Be good to yourself.

29:53.520 --> 29:54.360
Your Highness…

29:57.920 --> 29:58.920
Your Highness!

29:59.000 --> 30:00.080
Your Highness!

30:02.240 --> 30:03.760
Your Highness!

30:10.840 --> 30:12.560
Your Highness!

30:27.400 --> 30:30.880
Lately, I haven't seen you as often.

30:31.920 --> 30:33.240
State affairs have been heavy.

30:33.960 --> 30:36.600
Yet Your Majesty still
troubles yourself to visit me.

30:36.680 --> 30:37.520
It's my fault.

30:39.120 --> 30:41.400
If Your Majesty won't blame me
for Lady Wang's case,

30:42.160 --> 30:43.440
I already…

30:44.520 --> 30:45.880
feel deeply grateful for Your grace.

30:45.960 --> 30:47.840
She brought it on herself.

30:50.760 --> 30:53.800
As consorts, we should keep to our place.

30:54.560 --> 30:57.280
How could she think
she can enter the palace for favor,

30:58.080 --> 31:00.320
then run away for freedom?

31:00.960 --> 31:03.320
If she had really pulled it off,

31:04.040 --> 31:05.880
she would've set the worst example.

31:06.480 --> 31:08.880
The entire harem would be in chaos.

31:09.480 --> 31:12.080
This concubine lacks ability,

31:12.800 --> 31:15.480
but this is all I can do
to help Your Majesty

31:16.240 --> 31:19.440
keep the rules and hold the balance.

31:23.880 --> 31:26.480
It's getting late. Come.

31:27.160 --> 31:28.240
Let's dine together.

31:30.000 --> 31:32.080
CHENXIANG PAVILION

31:37.640 --> 31:38.800
My lady, look!

31:41.040 --> 31:42.240
Bad luck!

31:49.320 --> 31:50.680
Your Majesty, please step back!

31:51.640 --> 31:53.040
Guards!

31:58.760 --> 31:59.720
Save Consort Wei!

32:00.560 --> 32:02.040
Protect His Majesty!

32:02.120 --> 32:03.400
Protect His Majesty!

32:03.480 --> 32:04.800
Help!

32:04.880 --> 32:06.680
Help!

32:07.680 --> 32:10.920
Help!

32:15.040 --> 32:16.560
Help…

32:20.120 --> 32:21.200
Help…

32:22.040 --> 32:24.920
- You useless idiot!
- Consort Wei! Are you alright?

32:29.520 --> 32:31.000
Your Majesty…

32:40.440 --> 32:42.000
My face…

32:42.080 --> 32:43.200
- You…
- My face…

32:44.600 --> 32:45.880
My face…

32:48.000 --> 32:49.720
My face…

32:52.200 --> 32:54.280
Boss! Something happened
to Consort Wei yesterday.

32:54.360 --> 32:55.400
Consort Shu wants you to check it out.

32:55.480 --> 32:57.160
What happened?

32:57.240 --> 32:58.480
You know the Night-Wandering Maiden?

32:58.560 --> 32:59.720
The ghost-bird crow?

32:59.800 --> 33:02.440
Yesterday, they clawed Consort Wei's face
right in front of His Majesty.

33:03.840 --> 33:06.360
Since when did my bureau start exorcising?

33:06.440 --> 33:08.000
First, they had me
investigate the ghost infant,

33:08.080 --> 33:10.080
now it's a ghost bird. I'm not going.

33:10.760 --> 33:13.800
Boss, that bird isn't an ordinary bird.

33:13.880 --> 33:16.800
They say they're turned
from pregnant women

33:16.880 --> 33:18.560
who died with a grievance.

33:19.160 --> 33:22.160
Now everyone says Consort Wei is linked

33:22.240 --> 33:23.360
to the ghost infant case.

33:24.800 --> 33:26.960
Does Consort Wei keep the outfit
she wore that day?

33:27.040 --> 33:28.520
I asked.

33:28.600 --> 33:31.480
She said it was bad luck,
so she had it burned later.

33:32.320 --> 33:34.880
This season, crows crave lovefruit.

33:34.960 --> 33:36.520
Consort Wei favors bright colors.

33:36.600 --> 33:38.480
Someone stained her clothes
with lovefruit juice

33:38.560 --> 33:39.440
without her realizing.

33:39.520 --> 33:42.120
When the crows flew home,
drawn by the lovefruit scent,

33:42.200 --> 33:43.800
they attacked Consort Wei.

33:43.880 --> 33:46.680
That's the truth
of the "Night-Wandering Maiden."

33:47.280 --> 33:48.800
Then let's investigate
the Imperial Wardrobe Service.

33:48.880 --> 33:50.280
All laundry goes through there.

33:52.920 --> 33:55.560
Your Ladyship, Consort Shu
asked you to investigate this.

34:07.520 --> 34:09.639
There's a record of who washed
Consort Wei's clothes.

34:09.719 --> 34:10.560
We'll find out.

34:20.280 --> 34:21.440
No need.

34:25.040 --> 34:27.520
When did you get transferred
to the laundry?

34:28.719 --> 34:30.280
After Hanliang Hall was "haunted,"

34:30.360 --> 34:33.000
Ruisheng and I applied to transfer out.

34:33.600 --> 34:35.120
So Ruisheng is in the laundry too?

34:36.840 --> 34:38.520
She got transferred
to the Imperial Food Service.

34:39.159 --> 34:41.679
So, she stole the fruit,
and you starched the clothes.

34:41.760 --> 34:43.560
You really worked well together.

34:52.440 --> 34:54.159
You usually look dull,

34:54.719 --> 34:55.760
but this time, you were clever.

34:58.480 --> 35:00.120
So what now?

35:02.080 --> 35:03.240
What can we do?

35:03.880 --> 35:05.160
The only evidence

35:05.240 --> 35:08.400
that the clothes were tampered with
was burned by Consort Wei.

35:08.480 --> 35:10.120
There's nothing left to investigate.

35:11.680 --> 35:15.200
Heaven is watching, and karma's real.

35:15.280 --> 35:16.480
Who can predict?

35:19.640 --> 35:22.360
Come on. Let's report to Consort Shu.

35:22.440 --> 35:26.440
These mysteries are beyond my reach.

35:35.320 --> 35:36.920
Stay for dinner tonight.

35:37.000 --> 35:38.600
I had them make lamb.

35:38.680 --> 35:40.080
His Majesty will come too.

35:41.560 --> 35:44.920
His Majesty gets annoyed
just seeing me. I'm not staying.

35:46.920 --> 35:50.760
As for your marriage, His Majesty
is letting the matter drop.

35:51.360 --> 35:54.440
The eunuchs and maids who spread rumors
have all been slapped and expelled.

35:54.520 --> 35:57.960
You're still His Majesty's
most spoiled child.

35:58.760 --> 35:59.880
Consort Wei's crime

36:00.520 --> 36:03.000
was quietly pressed down.

36:03.080 --> 36:05.120
If His Majesty doesn't want to hear it,

36:05.200 --> 36:06.640
how could word ever get out?

36:07.640 --> 36:08.880
Peiyi…

36:10.960 --> 36:12.440
This storm

36:13.120 --> 36:14.800
has settled.

36:15.680 --> 36:17.600
Prince of Xin took a hard assignment

36:17.680 --> 36:19.120
and asked leave to travel away.

36:20.280 --> 36:24.680
After the crow incident,
Consort Wei went mad.

36:24.760 --> 36:28.440
She's recovering at Qinghui Palace
and can't return without summons.

36:29.280 --> 36:33.680
Prince of Xin's concubine
has died by her own hand to atone.

36:34.480 --> 36:37.120
So you can say you got justice
for Lady Wang.

36:39.280 --> 36:40.120
She died by her own hand?

36:46.720 --> 36:48.040
That justice wasn't won by me.

36:49.160 --> 36:52.480
And who has truly ever gotten justice?

36:53.080 --> 36:55.280
The innocent die for nothing.

36:56.280 --> 36:59.160
Those who take the blame die of guilt.

37:00.440 --> 37:02.720
Those who love freedom
clip their own wings.

37:03.280 --> 37:06.480
Those who are bound
spin their own cocoons.

37:09.080 --> 37:12.960
I can uncover the truth,
but I can't find justice.

37:14.320 --> 37:17.800
SWALLOW HOUSE

37:21.280 --> 37:22.560
Have you heard?

37:23.280 --> 37:24.600
Our marriage is set aside.

37:25.600 --> 37:27.960
As I said, I wouldn't drag you down.

37:28.680 --> 37:31.680
- So this was your plan too?
- What?

37:31.760 --> 37:34.480
Being trapped with me for a night,
the rumors spreading,

37:34.560 --> 37:35.800
and drawing Consort Wei out?

37:37.840 --> 37:39.360
You think too highly of me.

37:39.880 --> 37:41.520
If I could foresee things,

37:42.360 --> 37:44.960
I wouldn't have to make you play
the fortuneteller every time.

37:48.200 --> 37:50.480
You and I have been
through life and death.

37:51.280 --> 37:52.600
I don't want to owe you.

37:59.840 --> 38:01.120
Between two people,

38:01.200 --> 38:03.000
debts of the heart are inevitable.

38:03.080 --> 38:04.720
Connection breeds debts,

38:04.800 --> 38:07.120
and debts foster connection.

38:07.200 --> 38:09.600
If you desire no further debts at all…

38:15.080 --> 38:17.640
then we must part for good
and sever all ties.

38:19.880 --> 38:21.280
You're trying to scare me?

38:21.360 --> 38:24.240
I don't know which of your words are true
and which are false.

38:24.320 --> 38:26.640
I only said what was in my heart.

38:28.920 --> 38:30.400
What I said that day

38:30.480 --> 38:32.360
was to upset your father.

38:32.440 --> 38:33.960
He really spoke too harshly.

38:36.960 --> 38:39.280
It's fine. It's all in the past.

38:40.800 --> 38:43.080
I knew it. You were
eavesdropping that day!

38:44.760 --> 38:46.840
You were discussing
our marriage in my house.

38:46.920 --> 38:48.080
How is that eavesdropping?

38:48.160 --> 38:49.560
You were eavesdropping, anyway.

38:49.640 --> 38:50.520
I…

38:53.440 --> 38:54.680
Harsh words cut deepest.

38:54.760 --> 38:57.080
You spoke pretty harshly too.

38:57.920 --> 38:59.200
And you pretended you heard nothing

38:59.280 --> 39:00.560
and acted normal
while solving cases with me.

39:02.280 --> 39:03.560
That was for the bigger picture.

39:06.440 --> 39:09.120
You weren't secretly hurt, were you?

39:12.000 --> 39:13.960
Don't make yourself too important.

39:14.040 --> 39:16.600
Why is your forehead wound
healing so slowly?

39:17.200 --> 39:19.280
You're not tending to it properly,
just to make me feel pity for you?

39:21.360 --> 39:23.080
Utter… Utter nonsense!

39:25.400 --> 39:26.520
Ridiculous.

39:30.040 --> 39:30.880
Fine.

39:31.680 --> 39:33.960
It was my fault. I apologize to you.

39:38.600 --> 39:40.840
No need. I don't accept.

39:41.920 --> 39:42.920
Petty.

39:50.640 --> 39:52.000
Listen!

40:01.200 --> 40:05.880
See? This tune sounds best
outside the palace.

40:15.320 --> 40:16.880
May we all have fewer regrets.

41:19.560 --> 41:20.640
You look well.

41:20.720 --> 41:24.680
Thanks to Your Majesty's concern,
I recovered this quickly.

41:27.960 --> 41:29.320
After your illness,

41:30.040 --> 41:31.800
you look even younger and prettier.

41:33.200 --> 41:34.640
I wouldn't dare compete with you.

41:38.480 --> 41:41.080
Today's lip rouge really suits you.

41:43.080 --> 41:45.800
Reward Consort Li
with a pair of golden hairpins.

41:46.320 --> 41:47.280
Understood.

41:47.880 --> 41:48.880
Thank you, Your Majesty!

42:11.480 --> 42:15.600
Would Your Majesty
play a duet with this concubine?

43:03.720 --> 43:04.840
My beloved consort?

43:05.880 --> 43:07.440
Quick! Take Consort Li for treatment!

43:07.520 --> 43:08.920
- Quick!
- Understood!
